# Design system — Reactive

## Direction

Ink + Signal. Dark, technical, motion-led. **Not** purple gradients, cream/terracotta, or broadsheet layouts.

## Tokens (CSS variables in `src/app/globals.css`)

| Token | Role | Value |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `--ink` | Page background | `#0a0b0d` |
| `--panel` | Elevated surface | `#12141a` |
| `--foam` | Primary text | `#f4f5f0` |
| `--muted` | Secondary text | `#8b909a` |
| `--signal` | Accent / CTA | `#d6ff3f` → `bg-signal` `text-signal` |
| `--signal-soft` | Accent hover | `#e7ff8a` → `bg-signal-soft` |
| `--electric` | Secondary accent | `#5b8cff` → `text-electric` |
| `--line` | Hairline borders | `rgba(244,245,240,0.12)` → `border-line` |

Use Tailwind v4 theme utilities (`bg-ink`, `text-foam`, `font-display`, `max-w-site`) instead of `bg-[var(--…)]` / `font-[family-name:…]`.

## Typography

- Display: **Syne** → `--font-display`
- Body: **Instrument Sans** → `--font-body`
- Avoid Inter / Roboto / Arial / system stacks for marketing UI

## Composition rules (landing / promo)

- Brand first: product name is a hero-level signal, not only nav text
- First viewport: brand + one supporting sentence + CTA group + one dominant visual plane
- Full-bleed atmospheric hero (gradients/grid/orb) — no inset hero cards
- No cards in the hero; cards only when they aid interaction (e.g. section gallery, palette swatches)
- One job per section
- Prefer composed Server Components; GSAP in client islands only
- Ship intentional motion (loader, reveals, scroll, hover) — respect `prefers-reduced-motion`

## Portfolio user themes (product feature)

User portfolios use **preset palettes** with five tokens only (`primary`, `secondary`, `accent`, `textDark`, `textLight`). Preset list lives in `src/lib/landing-content.ts` (`palettes`).
